  "pv47:0.3": "",
  "pv47:1.1": "12 ayañca te pokkharaṇī surammā ",
  "pv47:1.2": "samā suppatitthā ca mahodakā ca ",
  "pv47:1.3": "supupphitā bhamaragaṇānukiṇṇā ",
  "pv47:1.4": "kathaṃ tayā laddhā ayaṃ manuññā. ",
  "pv47:2.1": "idañca te ambavanaṃ surammaṃ ",
  "pv47:2.2": "sabbotukaṃ dhārayati phalāni ",
  "pv47:2.3": "supupphitaṃ bhamaragaṇānukiṇṇaṃ ",
  "pv47:2.4": "kathaṃ tayā laddhamidaṃ vimānanti. ",
  "pv47:3.1": "ambapakkodakaṃ yāguṃ sītacchāyaṃ ",
  "pv47:3.2": "manoramaṃ ",
  "pv47:3.3": "dhītāya dinnadānena ",
  "pv47:3.4": "tena me idha labbhatīti. ",
  "pv47:4.1": "sandiṭṭhikaṃ eva passatha ",
  "pv47:4.2": "dānassa damassa saṃyamassa vipākaṃ ",
  "pv47:4.3": "dāsī ahaṃ ayyakulesu hutvā ",
  "pv47:4.4": "suṇisā homi agārassa issarāti. ",
  "pv47:5.1": "asātaṃ sātarūpena piyarūpena appiyaṃ dukkhaṃ sukhassa rūpena pamattaṃ ativattatīti. ambavanapetavatthu dvādasamaṃ. "
}
